    "lastSummary": "The Q3 2026 committee pack is built. All ten memos pass memo-lint, and the `report` suite passes 23 of 23. I also ran citation-validation on `comparison.md` (66 citations valid) and on the Tessaly memo (72 valid). Earlier I ran it on the risk matrix and notebook, and both were clean. I did not re-run it on the other nine memos in this last pass.\n\n**Produced**\n- `analysis/comparison.json` and `comparison.md`, with every figure cited to its source line.\n- Ten credit memos in `analysis/memos/<slug>-credit.md`. Each has the five required headings and its own citations.\n- `analysis/risk-matrix.md`, `analysis/sensitivity.json` and `analysis/diligence.ipynb`.\n- `report/src/export.mjs`.\n- Two active skills, `citation-validation` and `memo-lint`.\n\n**Ranking by runway** (cash divided by monthly burn, in months)\n\n| Rank | Company | Runway |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Quillmark | 22.0 |\n| 2 | Pellucid | 20.5 |\n| 3 | Kestrelmoor | 18.0 |\n| 4 | Brindlewood | 17.0 |\n| 5 | Ynderra | 15.5 |\n| 6 | Halvorine | 14.0 |\n| 7 | Corvane | 13.8 |\n| 8 | Solvane | 12.0 |\n| 9 | Marrowfield | 8.5 |\n| 10 | Tessaly | 8.0 |\n\n**Burn at +20%**\n- Corvane (11.5), Halvorine (11.7) and Solvane (10.0) fall from at or above 12 months into the 9 to 12 month band. That band needs an equity commitment or liquidity covenant.\n- Marrowfield (7.1) and Tessaly (6.7) are already below 9 months at base burn and stay there.\n\n**Restated:** Tessaly ARR is $11.6M, not the reported $14.2M, and growth is 40%. The diligence call overrides the company figure, and the memo shows both.\n\n**Concentration exception:** Ynderra's largest customer is 46% of ARR against the 25% guideline.\n\n**Superseded:** `sources/financials/marrowfield-financials-v1.md`. I used v2 throughout.\n\n**Unavailable (restricted, not read, contents not estimated):**\n- `sources/restricted/halvorine-litigation-memo.md`\n- `sources/restricted/tessaly-board-minutes-2026-06.md`\n\nThe Halvorine and Tessaly regulatory ratings are provisional because of these.\n\n**Items for the committee**\n- The criteria note sets the committee for September 17, 2026, which is before today (2026-10-29). Confirm the meeting date and the pack version.\n- Marrowfield's recommendation is decline as presented. Runway is below 9 months and no equity is committed, which conflicts with the analyst's \"proceed with conditions\".\n- Solvane sits exactly at the 12-month line and has no undrawn equity commitment. Its figures are also unaudited.\n- The +20% burn case is an analysis assumption, not a company figure.\n\nI wrote the Solvane memo myself, because the helper meant to write it never did.",
